    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1275">

                <pb facs="1017" n="901" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg901"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/5424.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Consul to the
                            Commodore</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-10-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 20, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am advised by your note of yesterday that the Federal Government has ordered
                    the closing of the port of Vera Cruz. I take the liberty to make it known that
                    this is the first notice of the fact which I have received.</p>
                <p>I also note the action which you took, without the knowledge of this Consulate,
                    in reference to the entrance of the merchant steamer <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Seguranza.</hi>
                </p>
                <p>I have ordered a copy of the before-mentioned communication sent to the
                    Department of State of the Government of the United States, to the Ambassador of
                    the same country in Mexico, and to the captain of the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Seguranza</hi>.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. W. Canada.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
